1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,718
Which negative prefix?

2
00:00:01,718 --> 00:00:05,950
Im before m and p: immature, impatient.

3
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:09,335
Il before l: illegal, illiterate.

4
00:00:09,335 --> 00:00:13,333
Ir before r: irregular, irresponsible.

5
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:17,330
In before most others: inactive, invisible.

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:21,588
And un with most plain English words: unhappy, unknown.

7
00:00:21,588 --> 00:00:24,726
When in doubt, un is the safest guess.

